OL,3,GNEWSA'Don't finish our sentences' says
OL,4,Aman with stammer
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Redcar man who has stammered since he
OL,7,Fwas a boy has urged others to be
OL,8,Fpatient whilst talking to people who
OL,9,Fstruggle with the condition.
OL,11,FSteve Knight, whose stammer developed
OL,12,Faround eight years old and has
OL,13,Fpersisted into adulthood, has redoubled
OL,14,Fhis efforts to raise awareness of the
OL,15,Fcondition following the success of an
OL,16,Faward-winning documentary about
OL,17,FTourette's Syndrome.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
