OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$ -,* %-.*,$%** %-& (,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'Don't finish our sentences' says
OL,4,Aman with stammer
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said people sometimes tried to help
OL,7,Fthose who stammer to get their words
OL,8,Fout and, while he acknowledged they
OL,9,Foften had good intentions, he said many
OL,10,Fpeople who stammer viewed it as rude.
OL,12,F"Listen, don't interrupt - let them
OL,13,Ffinish - and, for the love of God,
OL,14,Fplease don't try to finish their
OL,15,Fsentences," he said.
